==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Ancient Origins|Jolteon|26}} from the {{TCG|Ancient Origins}} expansion.
*This card's {{TCGP|Promo-A}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Vivid Voltage|Jolteon|47}} from the {{TCG|Vivid Voltage}} expansion.
*This card's shiny rare print features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Jolteon}}.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

